I Want to Eat Your Pancreas

04:50.190 --> 04:55.100
It happened in April, when the late-blooming cherry blossoms were still flush on the trees.

04:57.170 --> 05:02.160
I was absent from school to have the stitches from my appendectomy removed.

05:02.160 --> 05:06.950
Ticket number 52, please come to counter C4.

05:06.950 --> 05:08.320
Ticket number

05:06.950 --> 05:08.320
Kitakura Municipal Hospital

05:07.480 --> 05:08.320
I repeat.

05:08.710 --> 05:14.130
Ticket number 52, please come to counter C4.

05:08.710 --> 05:11.330
They said Aunt Akane had her baby.

05:11.720 --> 05:14.130
Really? I wanna see!

05:14.130 --> 05:16.460
I want to name the baby!

05:17.210 --> 05:18.400
I don't know about that.

05:18.400 --> 05:19.640
We'll have to ask her.

05:19.640 --> 05:21.990
But I wanna! Come on!

05:41.110 --> 05:42.690
h

05:41.110 --> 05:42.690
v

05:41.110 --> 05:42.690
y

05:41.110 --> 05:42.690
